            "created_at": "2025-09-19T19:08:47.775903+00:00",
            "notes": "This setup has been pretty standard since Stadium was released.\n\n[Threads of Fate](item_cb61612b-9d83-49a9-989d-013bf084fbcb) helps us maintain solid healing control over the team while also letting us accumulate more points throughout the match.\nIn my opinion, it remains the best starting option!\n\nAs a survivability ability, armor remains my go-to choice.\nOf course, you can go for something else but enemies usually have at least one hitscan, and this gives us a buffer in case we\u2019re left without cover for a few seconds. \n\nSoldier and Ashe are particularly dangerous for us, but Junker Queen, Zenyatta, and Genji can also give us a hard time in the early rounds.\n\n**Always look for a corner, a wall, or any obstacle that puts something between your body and their crosshairs.**\n\nLater on, you\u2019ll have a better chance of surviving while airborne\u2014but for now, play it safe!",
