            "created_at": "2025-09-19T19:08:47.775903+00:00",
            "notes": "In the fourth round, it\u2019ll depend on how many points you\u2019ve managed to collect, but as a safe choice, I always go for [Blessed Boosters](item_957fd380-b7b4-40d4-8333-bb8c535ca931)\n\nTo many it might seem like a waste of resources, but flying around at high speed helps us survive longer and support our team more effectively \u2014 especially if they\u2019re playing a dive comp.\n\nIf u have enough points and if you haven\u2019t picked it up earlier, you absolutely want to make room for [Angeleisure Wear](item_00b53ed7-0768-442b-a2c3-8d19608c9391)! \nIf u didn't before, you can also make space by replacing [Talon Modification Module](item_c0ca1795-a3ea-4dc9-ae17-f34122574b3a) with [Aftermarket Firing Pin](item_2485b212-b286-42d0-a2bd-20eb4396b054).",
